+"- `02629e21-ba1c-4f0a-a0f3-aee1e402dd26`: A generated 99.75% helper was rejected as implausible, but it exposed the relevant inline boundary. A natural local helper with a caller-owned loop counter and helper-local declaration order then reached 100%.",
